<title>UK: Hutchison to back Orange expansion-newspaper.</title>
<headline>Hutchison to back Orange expansion-newspaper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchison Whampoa of Hong Kong has agreed to fund an overseas expansion by British-based mobile telephone company Orange Plc, in which it holds a major stake, the Financial Times newspaper reported on Saturday.</p>
<p>The paper said Hutchison's backing would reassure investors concerned that overseas investment could set back the group's progress in Britain.</p>
<p>No one at Orange could be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
